00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,390
So that's true.

00:03:19,390 --> 00:03:24,390
So any poison or a toxin is an oxidizing agent

00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:29,270
and it is, it's cancer causing,

00:03:29,270 --> 00:03:30,950
it can damage cell membranes,

00:03:30,950 --> 00:03:32,950
