00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:40,190
it can be a cause for cancer by oxidizing the amino acids

00:03:42,390 --> 00:03:47,390
in the DNA, it can damage the DNA.

00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:51,710
So oxidizing agents can be damaging.

00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:54,710
However, there's a balance to that.

00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:57,750
Everything in physiology has a balance.

00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:02,030
Your body actually makes reactive oxygen species

00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:04,750
for the purpose of killing biotoxins.

00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:06,950
So when you have a biotoxin,

00:04:06,950 --> 00:04:11,670
